msgid "Run `bun run cat slice:sqlite -- --slice <name> --out <scratch>` and read the manifest: `bytes`, the row counts, the payload count and bytes, `overBudget`, `duplicateIds` and `findings`. Record the measurement in the work context with its provenance (the command and the date), beside the size of the source it replaces."
msgstr ""

